[0.010317, "o", "=== [1] Symptom: checkout disabled, CM says false\r\n"]
[0.043367, "o", "POST /checkout -> 201\r\n"]
[0.174003, "o", "checkout_enabled = false\r\n"]
[0.176242, "o", "\r\n=== [2] Demonstrate the bug: flip flag in repo, apply, watch it NOT arrive\r\n"]
[0.184662, "o", " k8s/20-app-config.yaml | 2 \u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[31m-\u001b[m\r\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\r\n"]
[0.441839, "o", "configmap/shop-config configured\r\n"]
[0.445747, "o", "--- waiting 15s, then checking the file INSIDE the pod:\r\n"]
[15.672459, "o", "checkout_enabled = true\r\n"]
[15.681323, "o", "(CM says:)\r\n"]
[15.757459, "o", "checkout_enabled = true\r\n"]
[15.775021, "o", "POST /checkout -> 201 (still disabled)\r\n"]
[15.77713, "o", "\r\n=== [3] Root cause\r\na) volumeMounts uses subPath: kubelet does NOT update subPath files on CM change;\r\nb) app reads the config once at startup (CFG.read at import time).\r\nFix: mount the CM as a directory (no subPath) + hot-reload in app by mtime.\r\n\r\n=== [4] Fix in repo\r\n"]
[15.799679, "o", "shop.py patched\r\n"]
[15.818276, "o", "30-app.yaml patched\r\n"]
[15.824189, "o", " app/shop.py            | 26 \u001b[32m+++++++++++++++++++++++++\u001b[m\u001b[31m-\u001b[m\r\n k8s/20-app-config.yaml |  2 \u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[31m-\u001b[m\r\n k8s/30-app.yaml        |  3 \u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[31m--\u001b[m\r\n 3 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)\r\n"]
[15.840083, "o", "a60800a A3: drop subPath mount, hot-reload config in app; flag reaches pods without restart\r\n5ce6516 A2: deploy vhost to sites-enabled (was dead conf.d), idempotent metrics allowlist\r\n"]
[15.841316, "o", "\r\n=== [5] Apply deployment change, wait for rollout\r\n"]
